      "originalText": "\u2022 MERGE :CONSUMES edges in\n  _save_odcs_to_graph\n\n\u2022 Engineer runs data_mapping\n  with --source-mode dprod\n\n\u2022 Mappings written as\n  :ColumnMapping \u2192\n  :DProdColumn",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
